  "maps.capEarthOrbit": "Tshifanyiso tsho itelwaho webusaithi iyi (nga mbalo). Ḓaka, mapfunda, mavhonela a dorobo na zwiṱoṱa zwo ṅwalwa u itela webusaithi iyi. A hu na tshithu afha tshine tsha vha mudeḽe u bva kha geme.",
