  "styles.colossalNote": "A hu na zwikepe, mbalo kana madeḽe a lushaka lwu. Lu kha tshivhalo tsha tshifhinga tshi ḓaho nahone a hu na tshithu afha tshine tsha vha tsho agwa.",
