  "styles.silLabel": "Mitsho mivhili ya zwikepe i re tsini na i nwe. Mutsho muṱuku u imela LEVIATHAN. Mutsho mutshele muhulwane vhukuma wo kovhekanaho u imela lushaka lwa tshihulu vhukuma lwa tshifhinga tshi ḓaho. Ndi fhethu ha tshinwe, a si dizaini.",
